            "cites": [1]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He has sponsored the Affordable Communities Act and measures on accessory dwelling units, Medicaid safety-net hospitals, and hospital worker staffing and safety. He sponsors the Municipal Home Rule Charter Act, which would let Chicago voters elect commissioners to draft a charter for final approval in 2030. He was the chief sponsor of a megaprojects measure passed by the House that allows developers to negotiate payments in lieu of taxes.",
